/* Documentation → Getting connected, Connecting to OBS section (Markdown: keep the ** markers) */
"The camera streams to a **LensLink Camera** source in OBS; the screen broadcast streams to a **LensLink Screen** source. Add the source in OBS, enter the phone's Wi-Fi address as its Phone IP — or plug in USB and set Connection to \"USB cable\" (Windows needs iTunes)." = "The camera streams to a **LensLink Camera** source in OBS; the screen broadcast streams to a **LensLink Screen** source. Add the source in OBS, enter the phone's Wi-Fi address as its Phone IP — or plug in USB and set Connection to \"USB cable\" (Windows needs iTunes).";

