/* Documentation → Options, Idle view section (Markdown: keep the ** markers) */
"**Idle view** is what the Live screen becomes 10 seconds after you last touch it, for a phone that's mounted and out of reach. **Standard** leaves the controls up. **Clean feed** hides everything but the picture — turn Stats on (status pill) before you stop touching it to keep the health readout. **Dim screen** blanks the screen and drops the brightness to save battery, and is the only one that also dims remote-start standby, a minute in. Any tap brings the controls back." = "**Idle view** is what the Live screen becomes 10 seconds after you last touch it, for a phone that's mounted and out of reach. **Standard** leaves the controls up. **Clean feed** hides everything but the picture — turn Stats on (status pill) before you stop touching it to keep the health readout. **Dim screen** blanks the screen and drops the brightness to save battery, and is the only one that also dims remote-start standby, a minute in. Any tap brings the controls back.";

/* Documentation → Options, Streaming section (Markdown: keep the ** markers) */
"**Pause** holds a stream without ending it — the phone stays connected, the camera stays on, and OBS shows a dimmed, blurred still with a pause symbol instead of a frozen picture. The pause button sits on the Live screen next to Stop, and the same control is in OBS (source properties) and the web panel. Audio keeps going, so the phone can still be your microphone while the picture is held." = "**Pause** holds a stream without ending it — the phone stays connected, the camera stays on, and OBS shows a dimmed, blurred still with a pause symbol instead of a frozen picture. The pause button sits on the Live screen next to Stop, and the same control is in OBS (source properties) and the web panel. Audio keeps going, so the phone can still be your microphone while the picture is held.";

/* Documentation → Options, Remembered settings section (Markdown: keep the ** markers) */
"**Remember camera settings** keeps each camera's exposure, white balance, zoom and focus from one stream to the next — a shot dialled in once stays dialled in, per lens. Turn it off and every camera starts on auto, and what was stored is forgotten." = "**Remember camera settings** keeps each camera's exposure, white balance, zoom and focus from one stream to the next — a shot dialled in once stays dialled in, per lens. Turn it off and every camera starts on auto, and what was stored is forgotten.";

